Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:07.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}愛してるって何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:12.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}辞書を引いてもピンと来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:17.63,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}そうね　愛って何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:22.60,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}語り尽くせぬこの痛みが愛なんかも
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:29.40,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}始まりの対に終わりを創る
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:33.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}神様はとても残酷だよね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:39.45,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}人間はきっと勇敢なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:39.45,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fscx60\fscy60\pos(501,666)}ぼくら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:43.95,OP-JP,,0,500,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}終わりを知れどまだ前へ進むから
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:49.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}何を引き換えにしようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:54.30,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}何度だって汚すよこの手なら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:59.05,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}後悔に似た罪の意識
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:04.01,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}隠して歩む道は何処へと続くの
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:12.52,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}いつか君が死んじゃうって想像するだけで痛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:15.19,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}心臓を握りつぶすのは誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:15.19,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fscx60\fscy60\pos(482,666)}こころ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.65,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}キミが愛なんだろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:22.32,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}いつか二人を引き離す終わりが迎えに来ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:27.58,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}誰も追いつけやしないスピードで
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:31.75,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}どこまでも逃げてみせるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:07.46,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}「我愛你」是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:12.71,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}查了辭典也毫無頭緒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:17.63,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}對啊 愛究竟是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:22.60,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}這道不盡的痛 或許就是愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:29.40,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}萬物有始必有終
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:33.98,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}神明就是這麼殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:39.45,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}人類一定都是勇敢的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:43.95,OP-CH,,0,500,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}雖知有終 卻從未停下前進的腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:49.25,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}無論代價為何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:54.30,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}無論要髒了這雙手多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:59.05,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}罪惡感亦如悔意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:04.01,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}將其隱蔽 帶著它走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:12.52,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}一想到你終將離世 我便痛入心脾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:15.19,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}究竟是誰握碎了我的心臟？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.65,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}是因為你即我的摯愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:22.32,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}即使總有一天 終結會將你我分離
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:27.58,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}我也會用無人能及的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:31.75,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}逃往天涯海角
Comment: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:11.19,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:14.44,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,Goodbye old self goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.58,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Now it’s time for me to take a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:31.37,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,You know I don’t want to lose anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:35.54,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Don’t wanna see the end I need this more
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:40.09,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I want to feel the warmth I can’t let go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:44.64,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Not gonna give it up because I know my strength
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.64,0:22:49.51,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I’m barely breathing but I’m keepin’ up to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.97,0:22:55.94,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:59.82,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I hide my trembling hand and just keep pushin’ on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.82,0:23:04.74,ED-EN,,0,300,0,,Cause the things I need to guard gives me the power to conquer carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.87,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Goodbye old self
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.87,0:23:11.16,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Never going back to the me I fought to leave behind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:14.83,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Hello new me, this time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(0,720)\fs30\k10\2a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}保{\k10}護{\k10}家{\k10}人{\k10} {\k10}便{\k10}是{\k10}我{\k10}現{\k10}在{\k10}的{\k10}一{\k10}切
